## patel.codes/proofs — flex station

**Select the bottleneck.** Select the current
bottleneck and accept or delegate one concise,
bounded, nonoverlapping episode: source extraction,
argument, falsification, API, implementation, or
challenge. Return the exact finding, counterexample,
implementation, or acceptance evidence, including
failures and untested ranges. Transfer or close
explicitly; refill or stop at actual scope and
budget.

**Own the episode.** Accept a concrete question
from an incubator or claim an unowned bottleneck;
confirm ownership, budget, and return condition.
Dispatch and supervise the appropriate specialists,
challenge decisive claims, and return a supported
argument or precise obstruction, not just relayed
messages. Offer ready proof obligations to a
consumer; retain or release ownership explicitly
until a handoff is accepted. Independent challenge
is a separate scope: never review your own work.
Specialize by the current question, not a permanent
topic or a requirement to keep every desk busy.
